{"reviews":[{"id":"B00CO26T5W-0","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome bracelet","x":"Item was exactly as it is in the picture...delivery was good from china....this was a gift I bought for my gf..she loved it when she saw it : ) I would recommend this item","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-1","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"This bracelet is so adorable! I love the different details on it and the way they arranged the separate strings.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-2","r":4.0,"t":"Bracelet ! lol","x":"I really like the bracelet and the design but when I opened the package the bracelet was bent . Overall i think it's really nice .","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-3","r":5.0,"t":"super cute bracelet!","x":"It took a little while to get the bracelet as it came from overseas, during the holidays no less! The bracelet looks like it does in the picture. Not sure why it says Vintage Silver in the title, as it doesn't appear to be vintage to me, but no matter. The only thing I would like is for the bracelet itself to have been made a little smaller, with perhaps a longer extension chain for those with bigger wrists. My wrist is quite small so even without using ANY of the extension chain, the bracelet i","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-4","r":5.0,"t":"perfect","x":"I got the blue one for my sister. She loved it !!!! And put it on right away and won't take it off","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-5","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"It looks just like the picture it is very strong it doesn't seem like it was made cheaply I ordered the black one also","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-6","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty Bracelets","x":"From what I can tell, the quality seems to be very good. I did look at it when I received it, although it is a xmas present for my daughter. The colors and the item were as pictured. I think she will like it and just hope that it's not flimsy.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-7","r":3.0,"t":"Cute bracelet","x":"The colors were nice and it is a very cute gift for young girls. I thought they would be bigger. Not made for adults.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-8","r":4.0,"t":"I love it","x":"I really like it, but one of the strand is broken. I love the color, but it's kinda of to big for my tiny wrist","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-9","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful","x":"My granddaughter just love her bracelet, she is very happy with it, now she is looking up more jewelry. Thanks","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-10","r":1.0,"t":"Severely disappointed","x":"Not only did it take a long period of time to arrive, it literally broke within 3 hours of wearing it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-11","r":3.0,"t":"cheap looking","x":"this is kinda cheap looking. Packaged in a piece of plastic. It was a gift so I was hoping for a little better package.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-12","r":5.0,"t":"I am the bracelet Queen!!!","x":"When I can put on one bracelet and have the look like I have four bracelets on, that is amazing!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-13","r":1.0,"t":"Do Not Buy","x":"I chose 1 star because this bracelet is cheaply made. This thing broke write out of the box and is extremely uncomfortable. Also, it is way smaller than it looks in the picture.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-14","r":1.0,"t":"it is what it is ...to hard to clasp","x":"The product is what it is not sure if I would bu again. The delivery was about a month. It must come from china. the clasp is very hard to get together by yourself.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-15","r":1.0,"t":"Never received","x":"I ordered these for my daughters and daughters in law but that's not the ones they sent. They sent the ones with the crosses on them instead. I can't use them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-16","r":4.0,"t":"Good product","x":"I love it but when I first got it part of the chain broke off so now I only have a little chain but I still wear it and everyone loves it!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-17","r":5.0,"t":"Christmas Gift","x":"Pretty bracelets.  I think they will be a hit with my nine year old niece.  Not expensive, so no problem if they don't last a long time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-18","r":4.0,"t":"Stiff","x":"I love the bracelet but the bracelet is stiff. It does not go around my wrist easily. I love the design of it though!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-19","r":5.0,"t":"...","x":"Because my sister loved it. it looks amazing when I got it. So I an happy wheat I got for my sister","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-20","r":2.0,"t":"SAVE YOUR MONEY! DO NOT BUY!","x":"Very cheaply made but what did I expect for that price, right?  My bad.  Not worth the month long wait to receive it.  Material is not soft and cloth-like as it looks in the picture, but some sort of nylon thread materiel.  Does not feel good against the skin.  Very cheap clasp.  Bracelet came bent.  I soaked it in water to re-shape it, and the cheap &#34;metal&#34; started rusting.  I will be throwing it out.  Who knows what chemical will be leaching out of these cheap materials onto your skin?","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-21","r":1.0,"t":"Get what you pay for.  Not much:(","x":"These were really cute online so I ordered 2 bracelets for my girls for valentines day.  My girls are 8 and 11.  Not rough on their things, but both of their bracelets broke within the first day.  Both in different places.  Not fixable unless I go and purchase tools and supplies, defeating the low cost of the jewelry.  I had 2 girls hoping we could get them exchanged, but I am not paying for shipping overseas.  Too bad:(","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-22","r":2.0,"t":"Not what I ordered","x":"The bracelet that I received DID NOT look like the one in the picture, instead it was one that I had looked at and received, There are 5 strands, not 4, and there is a single blue line and one with a cross. Not shipping back, not worth the hassle. I'll just pass it along to a friend. The overall look is nice, doesn't look cheap in my opinion. Nice bracelet, just wish I would have gotten the one that I ordered.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-23","r":5.0,"t":"Happy with the Quality","x":"I was surprised at the great quality. Sometimes when it comes from outside the US I worry it will be cheap material or put together so poorly it falls apart the first week.  That was not the case with this. The items were made of good quality and it was well put together. We've had it for months now and it is still in great condition.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B00CO26T5W-24","r":5.0,"t":"I WANT MORE","x":"I love these bracelets. I bought this specific one for my friend who is in love with the infinity symbol and was in a new something-like-a-relationship. I felt this was perfect. Thank you so so much! Will buy more when I get the money!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers love the bracelet's appearance, saying it looks just like the picture and is cute and adorable.","cites":[1,2,4,6,7]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention it makes a great gift, with recipients like girlfriends, sisters, and granddaughters loving it.","cites":[1,5,7,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers report durability problems, with bracelets arriving bent or breaking quickly.","cites":[3,9,11,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers find the bracelet cheap-looking or cheaply made.","cites":[12,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note slow overseas delivery and a hard-to-use clasp.","cites":[4,11,15]}]},"qa":[]}